{"data":{"listItems":[{"id":"4c0f7e3c-2838-472a-a3f3-d9482e494f03","slug":"to-saas-and-beyond","title":"To SaaS and beyond","description":"What does it take to steer a global software power from the SaaS era into the AI era? When Duncan Lennox stepped in as HubSpot CTO, he took on the high-stakes challenge of rearchitecting product strategy across a multi-billion-dollar company. In this keynote, Duncan breaks down how to balance legacy scale with rapid product development, providing an unfiltered playbook for leading massive organisational change.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T12:00:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T12:20:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"9c42fad4-f5a8-45cf-a373-69f6b6593329","name":"Stage 7","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"43418c09-e900-4688-b8c0-29c3f66caed9","name":"Duncan Lennox","company_name":"Hubspot","job_title":"CPTO","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/ftiocigvge8og3pk3v1ng8xoij5d?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/ftiocigvge8og3pk3v1ng8xoij5d?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/ftiocigvge8og3pk3v1ng8xoij5d?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/ftiocigvge8og3pk3v1ng8xoij5d?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/ftiocigvge8og3pk3v1ng8xoij5d?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"SaaS Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"44f06dcf-3b45-44c9-ba28-755b0345c346","slug":"palestine-meetup","title":"🇵🇸 Palestine meetup","description":"How many people from Palestine are walking around Web Summit right now? Let’s find out 👋! Meet, share insights, and spot familiar faces around the venue. See you there!","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T12:00:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T12:55:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"6dec8fa2-b1c3-411f-92da-ef6ffe3b72ca","name":"Meetup 3","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Meetup","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"16fe1819-c28f-47c8-9387-28560658a4c2","slug":"people-in-cybersecurity-meetup","title":"🔐 People in cybersecurity meetup","description":"Calling all people in cybersecurity at Web Summit: your people are here! 🙌🏼. Exchange insights, discuss challenges, and expand your network. Join us!","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T12:00:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T12:25:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"dbcc7fce-c386-44ac-8413-d38f8f32db58","name":"Meetup 1","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Meetup","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"d032b597-329c-49c2-8952-260087eed3d8","slug":"after-the-iran-war-a-new-middle-east-order","title":"After the Iran war: A new Middle East order?","description":"The war with Iran has reshaped the Middle East. As the dust settles, old alliances are shifting, regional powers are recalibrating and the balance of influence is being redrawn. This discussion will explore what comes next, from Iran’s future role and Israel’s regional position to the ambitions of Saudi Arabia, Turkey and the Gulf states, and the wider contest between the US, China and Russia. Who gains, who loses, and what will the new Middle East look like?","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T12:05:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T12:25:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"a4486f66-1f6a-4e29-a0bb-8da491e4a712","name":"Stage 11","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"a4d0044e-47d5-4ab9-b7e4-bf9f354ce092","name":"Angelica Oung","c